Text_en:
Dear nation of Iran!
Yesterday, the 22nd day of Bahman this year, you did a great job;
You made Iran proud;
You supported the Islamic Republic as always and added to its power;
The enemies who, in their statements, in their plans, seek the surrender of the Iranian nation, were disappointed.

Tonight's statements of the leader of the revolution about the 12-day war had a clear message in the field of foreign policy:
America and the Zionist regime failed not only in the field, but also in their strategic goal of breaking the rear of Iran's internal front, which means the collapse of the maximum pressure coalition and the weakening of Iran's deterrence.
